In the Business Logistics strategy, the platform is central to the management of physical flows to operate exchanges between peers. The platform plays the role of both an informational and a physical intermediary between the peers. Here, the challenge is to have a performative platform that allows trustability and reliability among peers. For example, Vestiaire Collective adds value to the second-hand products by taking care of everything: free collection from the giver, pricing, description, photography, storage and shipping to the final user.